7: (2)\nL58: Chapter: If one offers five Rak'a (instead of four)\nL59: \nL60: (2)\nL61: \nL62: باب إِذَا صَلَّى خَمْسًا\nL63: \nL64: Sahih al-Bukhari 1226\nL65: \nL66: Narrated' `Abdullah:\nL67: \nL68: Once Allah's Messenger (ﷺ) offered five rak`at in the Zuhr prayer, and somebody asked him whether there was some increase in the prayer. Allah's Messenger (ﷺ) said, \"What is that?\" He said, \"You have offered five rak`at.\" So Allah's Messenger (ﷺ) performed two prostrations of Sahu after Taslim.\nL69: حَدَّثَنَا cite10†أَبُو الْوَلِيدِ ، حَدَّثَنَا cite11†شُعْبَةُ ، عَنِ cite12†الْحَكَمِ ، عَنْ cite13†إِبْرَاهِيمَ ، عَنْ cite14†عَلْقَمَةَ ، عَنْ cite15†عَبْدِ اللَّهِ ـ رضى الله عنه ـ أَنَّ رَسُولَ اللَّهِ صلى الله عليه وسلم صَلَّى الظُّهْرَ خَمْسًا فَقِيلَ لَهُ أَزِيدَ فِي الصَّلاَةِ فَقَالَ ‏\"‏ وَمَا ذَاكَ ‏\"‏‏.‏ قَالَ صَلَّيْتَ خَمْسًا‏.‏ فَسَجَدَ سَجْدَتَيْنِ بَعْدَ مَا سَلَّمَ‏.‏\nL70: Reference  |  : cite16†Sahih al-Bukhari 1226 L71: In-book reference  |  : Book 22, Hadith 3\nL72: USC-MSA web (English) reference  |  : Vol. 2, Book 22, Hadith 317\nL73:   (deprecated numbering scheme)\nL74: \nL75: Report Error | Share | Copy ▼\nL76: \nL77: cite17†1225 cite18†1227 L78: \nL79: cite19†About | cite20†News | cite21†Support | cite22†Developers | cite23†Contact | cite0†Donate L80: \nL81: Hadith Text [Input]Arabic [Input]Translation [Input]Grade Reference [Input]Concise [Input]Detailed [Input]URL\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nSahih al-Bukhari 1479 - Obligatory Charity Tax (Zakat) - كتاب الزكاة - Sunnah.com - Sayings and Teachings of Prophet Muhammad (صلى الله عليه و سلم) (https://sunnah.com/bukhari%3A1479)\nciteturn87view1 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: today; Content type: text/html; Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"https://sunnah.com/bukhari:1479\",\"lineno\":null}); Redirected to URL: https://sunnah.com/bukhari:1479; Total lines: 81\nL0: Contribute to our mission cite0†Donate 